# 2026-06-11 [3.2-3] — keep customer-facing pages OUT of search engines.
# Jamie: "PRINTAVO PUBLIC INVOICE VIEW IS SEARCHABLE ON GOOGLE AND BING.
# I DO NOT WANT THAT."
#
# X-Robots-Tag at the edge is the bulletproof variant: it applies even when
# a page is reached via an external link (the exact way Printavo invoices
# leak into Google). NOTE: these paths are deliberately NOT blocked in
# robots.txt — crawlers must be able to fetch the page to see the noindex,
# otherwise a robots-blocked URL can still appear as a stub result.

/quote-approval/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow

/portal/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow

/customer/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
